inino<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #FFF; font-weight: 700;\">897<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #F472B6; font-weight: 700;\">36,1%<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #94A3B8;\">29,9%<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #34D399; font-weight: 700;\">37:03<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #E2E8F0;\">01:02:56<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #C4B5FD;\">01:01:33<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 700; color: #60A5FA;\">\ud83c\udfc3 5 km \u2013 Masculino<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #FFF; font-weight: 700;\">202<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #93C5FD; font-weight: 700;\">39,0%<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #94A3B8;\">6,7%<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #34D399; font-weight: 700;\">17:18<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #E2E8F0;\">32:08<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #C4B5FD;\">30:46<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 700; color: #F472B6;\">\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2640\ufe0f 5 km \u2013 Feminino<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #FFF; font-weight: 700;\">316<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #F472B6; font-weight: 700;\">61,0%<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #94A3B8;\">10,5%<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #34D399; font-weight: 700;\">20:31<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #E2E8F0;\">37:30<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px 8px; text-align: center; color: #C4B5FD;\">36:12<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border-top: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);\">\n<td style=\"padding: 11px 8px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFF;\">Total do Pelot\u00e3o Oficial<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 11px 8px; text-align: center; color: #FFF; font-weight: 900;\">3.000<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 11px 8px; text-align: center; color: #A78BFA; font-weight: 800;\">100%<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 11px 8px; text-align: center; color: #A78BFA; font-weight: 800;\">100%<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 11px 8px; text-align: center; color: #34D399; font-weight: 900;\">17:18<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 11px 8px; text-align: center; color: #E2E8F0; font-weight: 800;\">49:57<\/td>\n<td style=\"padding: 11px 8px; text-align: center; color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 800;\">48:30<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table><\/div>\n<p>  <!-- Bottom CTA Row --><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 0.88rem;\">\n      \ud83d\udd0d Procura o teu tempo individual, consulta o diploma e a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o completa:\n    <\/div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/resultados-bimbo-global-race-2026\/\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #6D28D9 100%); color: #FFF; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35);\"><br \/>\n        \u26a1 Classifica\u00e7\u00e3o Geral &amp; Pesquisa \u2197<br \/>\n      <\/a><br \/>\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/xistarca.pt\/resultados\/bimbo-global-race-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8); color: #C4B5FD; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none;\"><br \/>\n        10 km Oficial \u2197<br \/>\n      <\/a><br \/>\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/xistarca.pt\/resultados\/bimbo-global-race-2026-5km\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8); color: #C4B5FD; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none;\"><br \/>\n        5 km Oficial \u2197<br \/>\n      <\/a>\n    <\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO DE RESULTADOS E ESTAT\u00cdSTICAS --><br \/>\n<!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Bimbo Global Race 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Bimbo Global Race 2026<\/strong> (11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>27 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, em <strong>Bel\u00e9m<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Promovida pelo <strong>Grupo Bimbo<\/strong> com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Xistarca<\/strong>, a iniciativa \u00e9 uma das maiores provas solid\u00e1rias do mundo, onde cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 convertida em doa\u00e7\u00e3o de fatias de p\u00e3o para apoiar causas sociais e o Banco Alimentar.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio<\/strong>, o tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 totalmente plano ao longo da frente ribeirinha pelas <strong>Avenida da \u00cdndia<\/strong> e <strong>Avenida 24 de Julho<\/strong>. O programa integra a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (09:45), a <strong>Mini-Corrida de 5 km<\/strong> (09:55), a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (10:00) e a <strong>Kids Race<\/strong> (08:50), dispondo de cronometragem por chip, abastecimentos, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial e pr\u00e9mios de viagem para os vencedores.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">27 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, Bel\u00e9m, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Corrida 10 km, Mini-Corrida 5 km, Caminhada 5 km e Kids Race (200m a 800m)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Grupo Bimbo e Xistarca<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/xistarca.pt\/eventos\/bimbo-global-race-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 27 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:45<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgb