, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1 (at\u00e9 30\/06):<\/strong> 9.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/06)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2 (at\u00e9 07\/09):<\/strong> 11.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/07 a 07\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3 (at\u00e9 21\/09):<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (08\/09 a 21\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 4 (at\u00e9 23\/09):<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (22\/09 a 23\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (Secretariado):<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25 a 27\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Race (200m a 800m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 27 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:50<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1 (at\u00e9 30\/06):<\/strong> 5.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/06)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2 (at\u00e9 07\/09):<\/strong> 6.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/07 a 07\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3 (at\u00e9 21\/09):<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (08\/09 a 21\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 4 (at\u00e9 23\/09):<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (22\/09 a 23\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (Secretariado):<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (25 a 27\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida da Bimbo Global Race 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se a 27 de setembro de 2026. A partida e a meta est\u00e3o instaladas na Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, em Bel\u00e9m, Lisboa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento conta com a Kids Race \u00e0s 08:50 (200m a 800m), a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 09:45, a Mini-Corrida de 5 km \u00e0s 09:55 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 10:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento do kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento decorre na Decathlon Amadora na sexta-feira, 25 de setembro (10:00 \u00e0s 20:00), e no s\u00e1bado, 26 de setembro (10:00 \u00e0s 17:00). No domingo da prova, funciona na Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio das 07:45 \u00e0s 08:45 mediante taxa de servi\u00e7o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o cariz solid\u00e1rio da corrida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Por cada participante inscrito no evento, o Grupo Bimbo doa fatias de p\u00e3o a institui\u00e7\u00f5es de solidariedade social e bancos alimentares para apoiar comunidades desfavorecidas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento e fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais realizam-se online na plataforma da Xistarca com liga\u00e7\u00e3o direta e regulamento completo dispon\u00edveis no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Bimbo Global Race 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-27\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a do Imp\u00e9rio, Bel\u00e9m\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Grupo Bimbo e Xistarca\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": 